"""Reference-as-solution entrypoint for ``_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward``.

Entrypoint: :func:`run`.

Injection site (native FlagGems, no source patching):
  * accuracy: ``--override _upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward:<this file>:run``
    replaces the public attribute ``flag_gems._upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward``
    (``flag_gems/__init__.py`` registers it in ``_FULL_CONFIG`` and
    ``flag_gems/ops/__init__.py`` re-exports it), which is exactly the callable
    the untouched pytest case invokes.
  * core benchmark: ``benchmark/base.py::_candidate_call`` resolves the timed
    candidate through ``Config.override_registry.get_override(self.op_name)``
    with ``op_name="_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward"`` (the op_name declared
    by ``benchmark/test_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward.py``), so the same key
    and entrypoint are used for both phases.

The implementation is the operator's own ATen oracle, called on the original
target tensor (device, dtype, strides and storage offsets untouched). This file
imports only ``torch``: it does not import ``flag_gems`` and does not call any
replaced Gems export, so injection cannot re-enter itself recursively.

Frozen contract (``definitions/_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward.json``):
  * positional: ``grad_output`` (N, C, OD, OH, OW), ``output_size`` (3),
    ``input_size`` (5)
  * optional: ``scales_d`` / ``scales_h`` / ``scales_w``; ``None`` (also passed
    explicitly positionally by the master cases) keeps the
    ``output_size / input_size`` ratio
  * single output ``out`` shaped ``input_size`` with ``grad_output``'s dtype and
    device; ``effects.mutates == []`` and ``effects.returns_alias_of == {}``, so
    a freshly allocated tensor is returned and no operand or caller buffer is
    written -- the ATen default overload has exactly that behaviour.

Scope: this file intentionally implements only the default overload. The
``.grad_input`` overload (``_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward_grad_input``,
keyword-only ``grad_input`` out argument, separate Definition and out ABI) is a
different public export and op key, so its (preserved, unmodified) pytest and
benchmark cases are out of this operator's marker scope rather than emulated
here.
"""

import torch

# Resolved once at import time (the ``--override`` loader imports this file
# after torch is fully initialised) so the timed candidate is a plain call.
_BACKWARD_DEFAULT = torch.ops.aten._upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward.default


def run(
    grad_output,
    output_size,
    input_size,
    scales_d=None,
    scales_h=None,
    scales_w=None,
):
    """Return ``aten::_upsample_nearest_exact3d_backward`` for the given case."""
    return _BACKWARD_DEFAULT(
        grad_output,
        output_size,
        input_size,
        scales_d,
        scales_h,
        scales_w,
    )
